{"id":518,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"グローバル・理数教育で探究力を育む","feature_description":"立命館中学校は、高い学力の育成とグローバル・サイエンス教育を通じ、物事の本質に迫る探究力を育てることを目指します。学習と並行して研究活動や課題解決に取り組み、世界の最先端の知に触れて多様な価値観と向き合う経験を重ねます。SSHの理数教育、国際教育、高大連携・キャリア教育、探究を柱に、世界を舞台に活躍する人材を育成する方針です。","clubs":[{"id":10167,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10168,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10170,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10173,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10174,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10178,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10179,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10185,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10186,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10187,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10190,"name":"フェンシング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10191,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/nkc/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10192,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ritsumei.ac.jp/n